# Normalise line endings so a file edited on Windows and a file edited by a
# tool on Linux don't show up as a whole-file rewrite in every diff.
#
# Without this, `git diff` on this repo reported thousands of changed lines
# that were only CR characters — which buries real changes and makes review
# close to useless. `text=auto eol=lf` stores LF in the repository and leaves
# the working copy alone; every modern Windows editor handles LF fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
